{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛知県出身22歳の岡本姫奈です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日発売のアップトゥボーイさんに\n掲載していただいています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やったーー☺️☺️✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛いメイクに 好みすぎるお衣装に\n大好きなカメラマンさん📸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あっという間に時間が過ぎてしまった\nとっても楽しい撮影でした☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "加入した当初は\n緊張と自分の笑顔の苦手意識で一切笑えなかったのが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮影データ見返した時に 笑顔の自分が沢山写ってて なんだか嬉しかった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな幸せな日でした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobrop9iz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobO7j7nE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "セブンネットさんから予約していただくと\n私の限定ポストカードが付いてくるので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだ手に入れてないよーって方は是非！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobEhRbMr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⬆️これ ☺️\n🔗 https://7net.omni7.jp/detail/1107712857"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして明日からは 真夏の全国ツアーの神奈川公演が始まります！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お家で練習する時間\n大変だけど、やっぱり 好き"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "極度の心配性なので\n今日も沢山踊って自分を安心させてから寝るんだと思います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一番いいパフォーマンス お届けするので楽しみにしててね〜💃"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは！！\n明日会えるのを楽しみにしています🤍\nおやすみー！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobINvoxE.jpg", "alt": ""}], "source": "official"}